v 3
d sparkta2: interactive D3 maps and charts from Stata, as one self-contained HTML file
d
d sparkta2 writes a standalone .html file - no server needed, and with the
d offline option no internet needed to view it - holding an interactive D3
d map or chart built from the data in memory.  Choropleth, bivariate (two-variable) cuts, small multiples,
d rank-difference, hexbin, point, and basemap-backed maps, plus donut, bar,
d divergent-bar, line, and bar-race charts.  Two Texas geographies ship with
d the package: 254 counties (with US states and nation as backdrop layers) and
d 1,016 NCES EDGE SY2024-25 school districts; the engine also accepts any
d TopoJSON or GeoJSON FeatureCollection you supply.  Chart types sparkta2 does
d not cover are forwarded to sparkta (Fahad Mirza), installed separately.
d Neutral default colors and fonts; tx2036style and scheme(tx2036), an
d internal house style used in the authors' own workflows, are off by
d default.
d
d New in v0.8.13: overlays() with a variable outlines its groups on GeoJSON
d geographies such as texas_districts (it was skipped without a message),
d and a layer token there prints a note.  The default projection follows
d the geography, so Texas district maps and other custom geographies no
d longer lean unless projection(albers_tx) is given.
d
d New in v0.8.12: an upgraded install no longer keeps the engine files of
d the release it replaced.  net install, replace updates the ado files but
d not the two engine .js files; sparkta2 now reads the version on the first
d line of each engine file and replaces a copy that does not match, or
d prints a note when it cannot download the current one.
d
d New in v0.8.11: maps and charts stay valid under set dp comma and keep
d full precision for large values; bar2 draws negative values from a zero
d line and wraps long over() legends; long divbar labels break instead of
d running off the page; sparkta2_dashboard takes quoted paths with spaces
d and writes iframe paths relative to the dashboard; ~ works in
d rasterimage(); notes for out-of-range bins() and unknown scheme()/mode();
d the dispatcher rejects a repeated type() and lists duplicate sparkta
d installs when sparkta fails.  The default look changed: pages and charts
d are neutral by default (the donut uses the tableau10 palette); for the
d previous look add tx2036style scheme(tx2036).
d
d New in v0.8.5: line2 default axis titles fixed. A line chart that let
d xlabel()/ylabel() default put them on the wrong axes (the varlist is
d y x, so the horizontal axis is the second variable); explicit labels
d were always correct. See the line2 axis-order note in the help file.
d
d New in v0.8.3: line2 renders series that cross zero (axis spans the
d real data range, zero line drawn, tooltip rows labelled from
d ylabel()/xlabel()).  Repository moved to github.com/ericabooth.
d
d New in v0.8.2: linecolor()/linewidth() + basemapcolor()/basemapwidth()
d restyle the base feature borders and the backdrop outline.
d
d New in v0.8.1: classes(quantile|jenks|equal|std) + breaks() classification
d control; legends and axes default to variable labels; scalebar + northarrow
d map furniture; per-overlay colors/widths/dash; and the asset splice moved
d from the OS shell to Mata, fixing Windows forward-slash and spaced-path
d (OneDrive/Google Drive) failures.
d
d New in v0.8.0: dashtab() renders one full figure per level of a variable
d behind a tab bar (per-tab geographies via dashtabgeo(), so one file can
d switch counties/districts/regions); overlays() adds checkbox-toggleable
d boundary layers including a client-side dissolve of the focused features
d by any data variable; maplabels prints toggleable feature name labels;
d rasterimage() embeds a georeferenced image layer, still fully offline.
d sparkta2_dashboard gains a tabs layout.
d
d NOTE ON ASSETS: Stata's net install copies only recognised extensions
d (.ado, .sthlp, ...), so the bundled D3 / TopoJSON / d3-hexbin assets are
d ancillary files.  You do not need to fetch them by hand: on the first map
d or chart call sparkta2_findfile looks for them on the adopath and, if any
d are missing, downloads them from this repository into sysdir
d PLUS/s/sparkta2/ and reuses the cached copies afterwards.  Override the
d source by setting global sparkta2_remote_base before the first call.  To
d place them yourself instead, run: net get sparkta2, from(<this URL>)
d
d Requires: Stata 17.0 or newer
d
d Author: Eric A. Booth, Sr Researcher, Texas 2036
d Support: eric.a.booth@gmail.com
d
d Distribution-Date: 20261112
d
